Objective:
To evaluate system performance under load using Apache JMeter.
Test Environment:
Tool: Apache JMeter
Operating System: Windows
Users: 50 virtual users
Test Scenario:
The homepage of example.com was tested with 50 users using HTTP request.
Metrics Observed:
Average Response Time: 300 ms
Error Rate: 0%
Throughput: Stable
Observations:
The system handled all requests successfully without any errors. Response time
remained stable.
Conclusion:
The application performs well under normal load conditions.
Recommendations:
Further testing can be done with higher number of users for stress testing.
